# AXIS CELL: scrutinee type = ENUM with COMPLETE top-level variant coverage but
# a REFUTABLE NESTED sub-pattern x consumer = the DIVERGENCE gate
# (`live_stmt_diverges`'s `SMatch` arm). Its join-site twin is
# `n2_nested_uam.gg`; the two join cells cannot reach this consumer because
# their arms REINIT rather than DIVERGE.
#
# `Tag.A` and `Tag.B` are every variant of `Tag`, but each arm only matches
# payload `0`. `main` passes `Tag.A(1)`, so control falls out of the match with
# `s` still moved and `print(s)` is a use-after-move -- rejected by `gg check`
# with `error[E_UseAfterMove]`.
#
# This is the cell that trips when a contributor closes the divergence-gate
# over-rejection (pinned by `match_exhaustive_no_catchall_diverge_reject.gg`)
# with the ONE-BIT exhaustiveness verdict, by ANY route -- widening
# `match_has_catch_all`, or wiring a separate predicate straight into the gate
# and leaving `match_has_catch_all` byte-identical. It stays GREEN under the
# correct two-bit design, because a refutable nested sub-pattern is not
# irrefutably exhaustive.
#
# ⚠ SPELLING IS LOAD-BEARING: all-`PConstructor` top-level arms, no prelude
# variant -- see the note in `n2_nested_uam.gg`.
#
# RED-VERIFY 1 (pre-fix HEAD): ACCEPTED, rc 0, 6103 bytes of C.
# RED-VERIFY 2 (fuse the verdict AT THE GATE ONLY, leaving `match_has_catch_all`
# byte-identical): add a helper implementing the one-bit rule (unguarded arms all
# `PConstructor`/`PDotShorthand`) and nest it UNDER the pinned gate line, so the
# argument pin's exact text survives:
#   if not match_has_catch_all(arms):
#       if not <helper>(arms):
#           return false
# Measured: this cell flips rc 1 -> rc 0, 6103 bytes of C, while `cargo test
# --test lints self_host_match_fallthrough_predicates_pinned` stays GREEN and so
# do both join cells, the guard cell, the sibling-predicate cell, the non-enum
# divergence cell and all eleven pre-existing driver cells. It is the ONLY
# artefact in the net that sees that route.
# (Written the OBVIOUS way instead — `if not (match_has_catch_all(arms) or
# <helper>(arms)):` — the gate's argument pin does fire. The nested form above is
# the honest worst case, and it is the one measured here.)
enum Tag:
    A(int)
    B(int)

void sink(String ^x):
    pass

void probe(Tag g, bool c):
    String s = "hello"
    if c:
        sink(^s)
        match g:
            case Tag.A(0):
                return
            case Tag.B(0):
                return
    print(s)

void main():
    probe(Tag.A(1), true)
